B.aXy=new A.ef(["Madinah","The city that ran to meet him","Every roof emptied; every voice called the takbir; the date-palms were crowded with people. The hijrah was complete \u2014 and history\u2019s calendar began again from that year.","Seerah: Ibn Ishaq"])
