B.bo9=new A.da(B.azt,"Alif (\u0627) \u2014 Its sound comes from the empty space of the mouth and throat (al-jawf). Open the Letters school in the Academy and start the lesson for Alif: you will see the letter, practise it and answer a gentle question. Say its name three times, slowly. Which letter did you learn just before this one?")
